  "summary": "snmptt vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that SNMPTT did not properly sanitize trap data passed to\ncommands run through the EXEC, PREEXEC, and unknown_trap_exec options. A\nremote attacker could possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary shell\ncommands.",
